# MOTT's theme files, which tools/mkdemos.py puts on its drive beside the
# program: four pattern banks each, streamed into VRAM on the stairs; and
# the names of the creatures and things, a record each.
# One path a line, relative to the repository root; `reserve NAME size`
# is an erased file on a sector for the program to write -- its saved game.
assets/mott/MTHEME0.DAT
assets/mott/MTHEME1.DAT
assets/mott/MTHEME2.DAT
assets/mott/MNAMES.DAT
assets/mott/MPAGES.DAT
assets/mott/MLEVELS.DAT
assets/mott/MMUSIC.DAT
reserve MOTT.SAV 32768
